      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hercules%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town grew around the Hercules Powder Company plant, which later became Hercules, Incorporated.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.herculesca.gov/our-city/our-history"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Central Pacific Railroad first ran a line across Hercules’ waterfront in 1878, making it a key spot on the Transcontinental Railroad.",
